# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Break-glass ``cmkadmin``:** Seeded on first run via ``CMK_PASSWORD`` and re-converged onto the running site on every deploy; reachable via the local login form only when the SSO gate is absent."
msgstr "**Verre de rupture ``cmkadmin``:** Semences en première sortie via ``CMK_PASSWORD`` et reconvergé sur le site en cours d'exécution sur chaque déploiement; accessible via le formulaire de connexion local seulement lorsque la porte SSO est absente."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Break-glass `cmkadmin`:** Seeded on first run via `CMK_PASSWORD` and re-converged onto the running site on every deploy; reachable via the local login form only when the SSO gate is absent."
