msgid "**Central broker** one shared RabbitMQ stack consumed by many roles."
msgstr "**Courtier central** une pile partagée RabbitMQ consommée par de nombreux rôles."

msgid "**Central dashboard** (``files/dashboards/logs.json``, uid ``infinito-logs``): a log volume graph and one log view per application, repeated over the ``application`` label of Loki, with a free-text line filter."
