# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Pinned and verified:** the AppImage version and its sha256 live in the role, and a mismatch aborts the deploy."
msgstr "**Épinglés et vérifiés:** la version AppImage et sa sha256 vivre dans le rôle, et une inadéquation avorte le déploiement."

msgid "**Pinned bridge:** Add-on and server ship from one version-pinned distribution, so the two halves cannot drift apart."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Pinned image:** ``services.semaphore.image`` and ``services.semaphore.version`` in `meta/services.yml <./meta/services.yml>`__ pin the server to a concrete ``semaphoreui/semaphore`` release, never ``latest``. The ``🐳 Update Docker image versions`` job of `cron-update.yml <../../.github/workflows/cron-update.yml>`__ raises the pin in an update pull request. The next deploy starts the new server, which migrates the schema on start, and because the runner copies the ``semaphore`` binary of that image, the new pin rebuilds the runner as well (see **Runner build**)."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Pinned image:** `services.semaphore.image` and `services.semaphore.version` in [meta/services.yml](./meta/services.yml) pin the server to a concrete `semaphoreui/semaphore` release, never `latest`. The `🐳 Update Docker image versions` job of [cron-update.yml](../../.github/workflows/cron-update.yml) raises the pin in an update pull request. The next deploy starts the new server, which migrates the schema on start, and because the runner copies the `semaphore` binary of that image, the new pin rebuilds the runner as well (see **Runner build**)."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Pinned release image:** ``ghcr.io/infinito-nexus/meta`` from the project’s own registry namespace, pinned to a release tag rather than a floating ``latest``. The role declares no ``architectures``, so the deploy matrix may place it on either."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Pinned release image:** `ghcr.io/infinito-nexus/meta` from the project's own registry namespace, pinned to a release tag rather than a floating `latest`. The role declares no `architectures`, so the deploy matrix may place it on either."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Pinned tool surface:** ``files/mcp/tools.json`` holds the 24 read-only tools captured from the sidecar, pinned twice: ``tools.schema_sha256`` over the parsed mapping the adapter rehashes at startup, and ``adapter.specification_sha256`` over the file bytes."
msgstr "**Surface de l'outil épinglé:** ``files/mcp/tools.json`` détient le 24 outils en lecture seule capturés dans le sidecar, épinglés deux fois: ``tools.schema_sha256`` sur la cartographie analysée de l'adaptateur rechute au démarrage, et ``adapter.specification_sha256`` sur les octets du fichier."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Pinned tool surface:** `files/mcp/tools.json` holds the 24 read-only tools captured from the sidecar, pinned twice: `tools.schema_sha256` over the parsed mapping the adapter rehashes at startup, and `adapter.specification_sha256` over the file bytes."
msgstr "**Surface de l'outil épinglé:** `files/mcp/tools.json` détient le 24 outils en lecture seule capturés dans le sidecar, épinglés deux fois: `tools.schema_sha256` sur la cartographie analysée de l'adaptateur rechute au démarrage, et `adapter.specification_sha256` sur les octets du fichier."

# translated-by: libretranslate
