# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Single key, per-app subdomains:** one hidden service serves every app at `<app>.<node>.onion`, Host-routed by OpenResty."
msgstr "**Clé unique, sous-domaines par application:** un service caché sert chaque application à `<app>.<node>.onion`, hébergé par OpenResty."

