msgid "Derives the handle `<username>.<PDS_HANDLE_DOMAIN>` from the Keycloak username, or `i8-<username>.<PDS_HANDLE_DOMAIN>` when the PDS answers `Reserved handle`. A first label longer than 18 characters cannot be a handle; the broker then shows a form at `/sso/handle` where the user picks one of 3 to 18 characters from `[a-z0-9-]` that contains a hyphen and never contains `i8-`."
