msgid "Optimized for Archlinux environments, this role provides a lightweight, reliable solution for serving static websites. It automatically configures NGINX to serve files from a predefined directory, sets up secure HTTPS connections, and includes support for `.well-known` paths required by ACME challenges."
msgstr "Optimisé pour les environnements Archlinux, ce rôle offre une solution légère et fiable pour servir les sites web statiques. Il configure automatiquement NGINX pour servir des fichiers à partir d'un répertoire prédéfini, met en place des connexions HTTPS sécurisées, et comprend une prise en charge pour `.well-known` les chemins requis par les défis ACME."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Optimized for Archlinux environments, this role provides a lightweight, reliable solution for serving static websites. It automatically configures NGINX to serve files from a predefined directory, sets up secure HTTPS connections, and includes support for ``.well-known`` paths required by ACME challenges."
