msgstr "Les `GitHub Actions self-hosted runner <https://docs.github.com/en/actions/hosting-your-own-runners/managing-self-hosted-runners/about-self-hosted-runners>`__ est un agent qui exécute des tâches de workflow GitHub Actions sur votre propre infrastructure au lieu de GitHub-hosted machines."

