# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The app runs as a single Docker container and requires no database or backend setup, enabling secure and frictionless QR generation anywhere."
msgstr "L'application fonctionne comme un conteneur Docker unique et ne nécessite aucune configuration de base de données ou de moteur, permettant une génération QR sécurisée et sans friction n'importe où."

msgid "The app speaks only the Upstash REST dialect through the bundled proxy, and upstream runs Redis with `allkeys-lru` eviction that must not apply to other consumers."
