msgid "The app's `meta/services.yml`, like the inventory, may override either default: `login.method.2fa.enabled: true` runs the app's own second factor beside Keycloak, and `login.method.2fa.enforced: false` only offers it. Keycloak's enforcement is realm-wide, so `totp_enforced: false` switches it off for every app of the realm at once, as every Keycloak variant and the development inventory do for automated logins."
