msgid "The same variable points ```sys-ctl-mtn-cert-deploy`` <../sys-ctl-mtn-cert-deploy/>`__\\ ’s remote check at ``:465`` and ``:993``, so the live TLS chain and its remaining validity are verified alongside. A misconfigured production server therefore fails the deploy instead of surfacing as an outage."
