msgid "There is no length floor. :func:`verdict` reaches this only once an exact echo is ruled out, so Latin text that differs from the source cannot be a term the language keeps in English. The catalogs are mostly one- to four-word labels, which is where the wrong language hid for as long as a six-word floor stood here."
msgstr ""

msgid "There is no standalone `make` target for Playwright. Tests run as part of local deploy flows (e.g. `make compose-deploy mode=reinstall apps=web-app-matomo full_cycle=true`). For spec-only iteration after the first successful deploy, see [Playwright Spec Loop](../../../../agents/skills/i8-iterate-playwright/SKILL.md)."
