msgid "This role is the single point of truth for the release pins of the lint tools that the toolchain installs from GitHub releases: [actionlint](https://github.com/rhysd/actionlint), [hadolint](https://github.com/hadolint/hadolint) and [shfmt](https://github.com/mvdan/sh)."
msgstr "Ce rôle est le seul point de vérité pour les broches de libération des outils de lint que la chaîne d'outils installe à partir des versions GitHub: [actioninte](https://github.com/rhysd/actionlint), [hadolint](https://github.com/hadolint/hadolint) et [Shfmt](https://github.com/mvdan/sh)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role is the single point of truth for the release pins of the lint tools that the toolchain installs from GitHub releases: `actionlint <https://github.com/rhysd/actionlint>`__, `hadolint <https://github.com/hadolint/hadolint>`__ and `shfmt <https://github.com/mvdan/sh>`__."
msgstr "Ce rôle est le seul point de vérité pour les broches de libération des outils de lint que la chaîne d'outils installe à partir des versions GitHub: `actionlint <https://github.com/rhysd/actionlint>`__, `hadolint <https://github.com/hadolint/hadolint>`__ et `shfmt <https://github.com/mvdan/sh>`__."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role letsEncrypt TLS provider for sys-front-tls. Ensures certificate presence."
msgstr "Ce rôle permet de chiffrer le fournisseur TLS pour sys-front-tls. Assurer la présence du certificat."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role manages GNOME Shell extensions by ensuring user extensions are enabled and by installing the CLI GNOME Extension Manager. The CLI tool facilitates the configuration and control of GNOME extensions via the command line."
msgstr "Ce rôle gère GNOME Shell les extensions en s'assurant que les extensions utilisateur sont activées et en installant le gestionnaire d'extension CLI GNOME. L'outil CLI facilite la configuration et le contrôle des extensions GNOME via la ligne de commande."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role manages the generation and handling of an SSH key for the [root user](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Superuser) on a target system. It ensures that an SSH key is generated if one does not already exist and outputs the public key, enabling secure SSH access for the root user in automated environments."
msgstr "Ce rôle gère la génération et la manipulation d'une clé SSH pour [utilisateur racine](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Superuser) sur un système cible. Il s'assure qu'une clé SSH est générée si elle n'existe pas déjà et produit la clé publique, permettant un accès sécurisé à la SSH pour l'utilisateur racine dans des environnements automatisés."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role manages the generation and handling of an SSH key for the `root user <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Superuser>`__ on a target system. It ensures that an SSH key is generated if one does not already exist and outputs the public key, enabling secure SSH access for the root user in automated environments."
msgstr "Ce rôle gère la génération et la manipulation d'une clé SSH pour `root user <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Superuser>`__ sur un système cible. Il s'assure qu'une clé SSH est générée si elle n'existe pas déjà et produit la clé publique, permettant un accès sécurisé à la SSH pour l'utilisateur racine dans des environnements automatisés."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role monitors the health status of Docker containers on the system. It detects containers that are either **unhealthy** or have **exited with a non-zero code**, and triggers alerts if issues are found."
msgstr "Ce rôle surveille l'état de santé des contenants Docker sur le système. Il détecte les conteneurs qui sont soit **malsain** ou ont **sortie avec un code non zéro**, et déclenche des alertes si des problèmes sont trouvés."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role no longer ships its own local recording wrapper."
msgstr "Ce rôle n'expédie plus son propre emballage d'enregistrement local."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role now supports OpenID Connect (OIDC) authentication with [Mailu-OIDC](https://github.com/heviat/Mailu-OIDC)! 🎉"
msgstr "Ce rôle prend désormais en charge OpenID Connect (OIDC) authentification avec [Mailu-OIDC](https://github.com/heviat/Mailu-OIDC)- Oui. 🎉"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role optimizes storage allocation for Docker volumes by migrating volumes between SSD (rapid storage) and HDD (mass storage) based on container image types. It creates symbolic links to maintain consistent storage paths after migration."
msgstr "Ce rôle optimise l'allocation de stockage pour les volumes Docker par migration des volumes entre SSD (stockage rapide) et du DDH (stockage de masse) basé sur les types d'image de conteneur. Il crée des liens symboliques pour maintenir des chemins de stockage cohérents après la migration."

msgid "This role owns the ``design`` service flag and the corporate design configuration (``services.design.colors``, ``services.design.font``), and declares ``web-svc-cdn`` as the upstream that serves the actual CSS bytes. Consumer roles gate design-dependent surfaces on ``'web-svc-design' in group_names`` via their own ``meta/services.yml``. An enabled ``design`` flag injects the shared CSS and activates the JavaScript injection of the consumer; ``javascript`` stays independently switchable. The role’s canonical domain 301-redirects to the CDN’s canonical domain so health probes against the design hostname return a valid response."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role owns the `design` service flag and the corporate design configuration (`services.design.colors`, `services.design.font`), and declares `web-svc-cdn` as the upstream that serves the actual CSS bytes. Consumer roles gate design-dependent surfaces on `'web-svc-design' in group_names` via their own `meta/services.yml`. An enabled `design` flag injects the shared CSS and activates the JavaScript injection of the consumer; `javascript` stays independently switchable. The role's canonical domain 301-redirects to the CDN's canonical domain so health probes against the design hostname return a valid response."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role performs a complete cleanup of Docker resources by invoking a systemd-managed script. It removes unused Docker images, stopped containers, networks, build cache, and anonymous volumes. The cleanup is fully automated and can run on a schedule or be triggered manually."
msgstr "Ce rôle effectue un nettoyage complet des ressources Docker en invoquant un script géré par système. Il supprime les images Docker inutilisées, les conteneurs arrêtés, les réseaux, construit le cache et les volumes anonymes. Le nettoyage est entièrement automatisé et peut fonctionner selon un calendrier ou être déclenché manuellement."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role provides a **unified mail setup** for your hosts:"
msgstr "Ce rôle **configuration unifiée du courriel** pour vos hôtes:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role provides a comprehensive Dockerized environment for running Akaunting. It deploys the Akaunting application alongside a MariaDB database, configures environment variables, and integrates with NGINX as a reverse proxy. This setup is ideal for both production and development environments."
msgstr "Ce rôle fournit un environnement complet Akaunting. Il déploie les Akaunting la demande ainsi que MariaDB base de données, configure les variables d'environnement et s'intègre avec NGINX comme proxy inverse. Cette configuration est idéale pour les environnements de production et de développement."

msgid "This role provides a fully automated deployment of [BigBlueButton](https://bigbluebutton.org/) using Docker Compose on Arch Linux. It manages the entire lifecycle of the deployment, from cloning the upstream Docker repository and generating the `.env` configuration to customizing `compose.yml` for volume usage, WebSocket proxying, and optional OIDC integration. The setup includes conditional Greenlight activation, WebRTC support via TURN/STUN, and various fixes for known container orchestration issues. The role is modular and integrates seamlessly with the Infinito.Nexus infrastructure, including reverse proxy configuration, domain management, and secrets templating. By default, BigBlueButton is deployed with best-practice hardening, modular secrets, and support for multiple authentication methods and scalable storage backends."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role provides a fully automated deployment of `BigBlueButton <https://bigbluebutton.org/>`__ using Docker Compose on Arch Linux. It manages the entire lifecycle of the deployment, from cloning the upstream Docker repository and generating the ``.env`` configuration to customizing ``compose.yml`` for volume usage, WebSocket proxying, and optional OIDC integration. The setup includes conditional Greenlight activation, WebRTC support via TURN/STUN, and various fixes for known container orchestration issues. The role is modular and integrates seamlessly with the Infinito.Nexus infrastructure, including reverse proxy configuration, domain management, and secrets templating. By default, BigBlueButton is deployed with best-practice hardening, modular secrets, and support for multiple authentication methods and scalable storage backends."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role provides a locking mechanism that delays maintenance activities such as updates, backups, or patch applications while conflicting services run. It waits for the specified services to stop, up to a timeout."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role provides assets"
msgstr "Ce rôle fournit des atouts"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role provides the essential tooling for Python developers, enabling immediate use of ``python`` and ``pip`` from the command line. It supports both general-purpose scripting and advanced software engineering workflows."
msgstr "Ce rôle fournit l'outil essentiel pour les développeurs de Python, permettant une utilisation immédiate de ``python`` et ``pip`` depuis la ligne de commande. Il prend en charge à la fois le script à usage général et les flux de travail avancés d'ingénierie logicielle."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role provides the essential tooling for Python developers, enabling immediate use of `python` and `pip` from the command line. It supports both general-purpose scripting and advanced software engineering workflows."
msgstr "Ce rôle fournit l'outil essentiel pour les développeurs de Python, permettant une utilisation immédiate de `python` et `pip` depuis la ligne de commande. Il prend en charge à la fois le script à usage général et les flux de travail avancés d'ingénierie logicielle."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role provisions a complete Nextcloud deployment using Docker Compose. It automates the setup of the Nextcloud application along with its underlying MariaDB database and configures the system for secure public access via an NGINX reverse proxy. The deployment includes automated configuration merging into ``config.php``, health check routines, and integrated support for backup and recovery operations."
msgstr "Ce rôle prévoit une Nextcloud déploiement en utilisant Docker Compose. Il automatise la configuration du Nextcloud application ainsi que son sous-jacent MariaDB base de données et configure le système pour un accès public sécurisé via un proxy inverse NGINX. Le déploiement inclut la configuration automatisée fusion dans ``config.php``, les routines de contrôle de santé, et le soutien intégré pour les opérations de sauvegarde et de récupération."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role provisions a complete Nextcloud deployment using Docker Compose. It automates the setup of the Nextcloud application along with its underlying MariaDB database and configures the system for secure public access via an NGINX reverse proxy. The deployment includes automated configuration merging into `config.php`, health check routines, and integrated support for backup and recovery operations."
msgstr "Ce rôle prévoit une Nextcloud déploiement en utilisant Docker Compose. Il automatise la configuration du Nextcloud application ainsi que son sous-jacent MariaDB base de données et configure le système pour un accès public sécurisé via un proxy inverse NGINX. Le déploiement inclut la configuration automatisée fusion dans `config.php`, les routines de contrôle de santé, et le soutien intégré pour les opérations de sauvegarde et de récupération."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role provisions a dedicated machine as one or more GitHub Actions self-hosted CI runners for Infinito.Nexus. Each runner instance runs as an ephemeral Docker container (DooD — Docker out of Docker): the container mounts the host's `/var/run/docker.sock` and uses it to start a fresh Infinito DinD container for each CI job, then tears it down when the job finishes."
msgstr "Ce rôle fournit une machine dédiée comme un ou plusieurs coureurs d'IC GitHub Actions Infinito.Nexus. Chaque instance coureur fonctionne comme un conteneur Docker éphémère (DooD — Docker hors de Docker): le conteneur monte l'hôte `/var/run/docker.sock` et l'utilise pour démarrer un conteneur Infinito DinD frais pour chaque travail CI, puis le déchire quand le travail finit."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role provisions a dedicated machine as one or more GitHub Actions self-hosted CI runners for Infinito.Nexus. Each runner instance runs as an ephemeral Docker container (DooD — Docker out of Docker): the container mounts the host’s ``/var/run/docker.sock`` and uses it to start a fresh Infinito DinD container for each CI job, then tears it down when the job finishes."
msgstr "Ce rôle fournit une machine dédiée comme un ou plusieurs coureurs d'IC GitHub Actions Infinito.Nexus. Chaque instance coureur fonctionne comme un conteneur Docker éphémère (DooD — Docker hors de Docker): le conteneur monte l'hôte ``/var/run/docker.sock`` et l'utilise pour démarrer un conteneur Infinito DinD frais pour chaque travail CI, puis le déchire quand le travail finit."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role provisions a local Root CA (self-signed, CA:TRUE) for trusting internal TLS endpoints. Produces /etc/infinito.nexus/ca/root-ca.crt for sys-svc-compose-ca injection."
msgstr "Ce rôle prévoit une CA locale racine (autosigné, CA:TRUE) pour faire confiance aux paramètres TLS internes. Produits /etc/infinito.nexus/ca/root-ca.crt pour sys-svc-compose-ca injection."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role provisions the isolating runtime layer of a container host. It installs the pinned gVisor binary, then re-runs the daemon configuration of the container role so the freshly installed runtime is registered and the daemon is restarted onto it. In swarm mode it additionally labels the node as sandbox-isolating, which is the placement constraint that keeps sandboxed workloads off nodes that still default to the shared kernel."
msgstr "Ce rôle permet d'isoler la couche d'exécution d'un conteneur hôte. Il installe le binaire de gVisor épinglé, puis réexécute la configuration de démon du rôle de conteneur de sorte que l'exécution fraîchement installée est enregistrée et le démon est redémarré sur lui. En mode swarm, il étiquette en outre le nœud comme sandbox-isolant, qui est la contrainte de placement qui maintient les charges de travail sandboxed hors des nœuds qui restent par défaut au noyau partagé."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role provisions:"
msgstr "Ce rôle prévoit:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role publishes the Infinito.Nexus documentation for the latest commit and for every release tag. It builds the repository's Markdown, reStructuredText and role READMEs into an HTML site with [Sphinx](https://www.sphinx-doc.org/) and the [Awesome Sphinx Theme](https://sphinxawesome.xyz/). There is no database."
msgstr "Ce rôle publie Infinito.Nexus documentation pour le dernier commit et pour chaque balise de publication. Il construit le Markdown du dépôt, reStructuredText et le rôle README dans un site HTML avec [Sphinx](https://www.sphinx-doc.org/) et les [Sphinx impressionnant Thème](https://sphinxawesome.xyz/). Il n'y a pas de base de données."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role publishes the Infinito.Nexus documentation for the latest commit and for every release tag. It builds the repository’s Markdown, reStructuredText and role READMEs into an HTML site with `Sphinx <https://www.sphinx-doc.org/>`__ and the `Awesome Sphinx Theme <https://sphinxawesome.xyz/>`__. There is no database."
msgstr "Ce rôle publie Infinito.Nexus documentation pour le dernier commit et pour chaque balise de publication. Il construit le dépôt de Markdown, reStructuredText et le rôle README dans un site HTML avec `Sphinx <https://www.sphinx-doc.org/>`__ et les `Awesome Sphinx Theme <https://sphinxawesome.xyz/>`__. Il n'y a pas de base de données."

msgid "This role puts WireGuard under a swarm deployment so that swarm control, overlay and storage traffic never crosses an untunnelled network. It configures the hub-and-spoke meshes the deployment declares, any number of them, with the swarm manager as the hub of each. The manager forwards between them, which is how a worker reaches an NFS export it is not a member of."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role re-invokes each deployed MCP client's own reconciliation from the complete provider set."
msgstr "Ce rôle réinvoque chaque client MCP déployé le rapprochement propre du fournisseur complet."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role re-invokes each deployed MCP client’s own reconciliation from the complete provider set."
msgstr "Ce rôle réinvoque chaque client MCP déployé dans son propre rapprochement de l'ensemble complet du fournisseur."

msgid "This role refreshes the package index and upgrades every installed package on the host. ``tasks/main.yml`` reads ``ansible_facts['distribution']`` and dispatches to one task file per package-manager family. Debian and Ubuntu both use ``apt``, so they share a single task file; Fedora and CentOS both use ``dnf``, and CentOS reaches ``fedora.yml`` through ``centos.yml``. A separate ``unsupported.yml`` fails loudly with a clear message when a host runs a distribution that this role does not yet cover."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role refreshes the package index and upgrades every installed package on the host. `tasks/main.yml` reads `ansible_facts['distribution']` and dispatches to one task file per package-manager family. Debian and Ubuntu both use `apt`, so they share a single task file; Fedora and CentOS both use `dnf`, and CentOS reaches `fedora.yml` through `centos.yml`. A separate `unsupported.yml` fails loudly with a clear message when a host runs a distribution that this role does not yet cover."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role replaces the end-of-life [`web-app-mailu`](../web-app-mailu/) role. Applications send mail through the same provider-agnostic abstraction (`lookup('email')` / [`sys-svc-mail`](../sys-svc-mail/)) — no consumer changes are needed beyond the provider repoint."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role replaces the end-of-life ```web-app-mailu`` <../web-app-mailu/>`__ role. Applications send mail through the same provider-agnostic abstraction (``lookup('email')`` / ```sys-svc-mail`` <../sys-svc-mail/>`__) — no consumer changes are needed beyond the provider repoint."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role runs Proxmox VE as one Docker container, in a data center or locally, as the hypervisor for agent VM workspaces. It builds its own image from the official Debian base and the official ``pve-no-subscription`` repository at the pinned ``services.proxmox.ve.version``, uses no third-party image and changes nothing about the subscription notice. The web UI is served at its own domain through the front proxy, and the agent broker (``svc-ai-agent-broker``) drives the agent VMs through a pool-scoped API token over the internal address."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role runs Proxmox VE as one Docker container, in a data center or locally, as the hypervisor for agent VM workspaces. It builds its own image from the official Debian base and the official `pve-no-subscription` repository at the pinned `services.proxmox.ve.version`, uses no third-party image and changes nothing about the subscription notice. The web UI is served at its own domain through the front proxy, and the agent broker (`svc-ai-agent-broker`) drives the agent VMs through a pool-scoped API token over the internal address."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role runs a collected list of systemd services at the end of a play."
msgstr "Ce rôle gère une liste de services système collectés à la fin d'une pièce."

msgid "This role runs the pre-flight checks of Infinito.Nexus. The constructor stage in ``tasks/stages/01_constructor.yml`` includes it on every host after the shared services are placed and before any package is installed."
