# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Upstream ``host:port``: compose ``127.0.0.1:<local>``; swarm ``<entity>:<internal>`` (shared-overlay alias) for the app frontend, or ``<entity>_<service_key>:<internal>`` for named sidecars (sso-proxy). A ``host_gateway`` app runs node-local under swarm and publishes its local port to the host, so the overlay-attached proxy reaches it at ``host.docker.internal:<local>`` via the host gateway (the caller sets this off the real DEPLOYMENT_MODE, since such apps force a compose-style render). Missing swarm internal port hard-fails."
msgstr "En amont ``host:port``: composer ``127.0.0.1:<local>``; essaim ``<entity>:<internal>`` (alias partagé) pour la façade de l'appendice, ou ``<entity>_<service_key>:<internal>`` pour les sidecars nommés (sso-proxy). A ``host_gateway`` l'application gère noeud-local sous essaim et publie son port local à l'hôte, de sorte que le proxy attaché ``host.docker.internal:<local>`` via la passerelle hôte (l'appelant déclenche le réel DEPLOYMENT_MODE, puisque ces applications forcent un rendu de style composer)Il manque un essaim interne."

