msgid "[x] **Iteration loop.** The agent MUST follow the [Workflow Loop](../../agents/skills/i8-iterate-workflow/SKILL.md) for every change to GitHub Actions workflows the implementation touches, and the [Compose Loop](../../agents/skills/i8-iterate-compose/SKILL.md) for every change inside `roles/svc-runner/`. The agent MUST NOT skip the loop's debug-locally step in favour of remote CI reruns."
