# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SEMAPHORE_OIDC_PROVIDERS` = JSON map. Per-provider: `display_name`, `provider_url` (issuer), `client_id`, `client_secret`, `redirect_url`. Redirect path is `https://<host>/api/auth/oidc/<provider_id>/redirect`. **Semaphore has native OIDC — no `oauth2-proxy` sidecar needed.**"
msgstr "`SEMAPHORE_OIDC_PROVIDERS` = carte JSON. Par fournisseur: `display_name`, `provider_url` (émetteur), `client_id`, `client_secret`, `redirect_url`. Le chemin de redirection est `https://<host>/api/auth/oidc/<provider_id>/redirect`. **Le sémaphore a un OIDC natif — non `oauth2-proxy` Sidecar nécessaire.**"

